-->
     <para>修复 <filename>contrib/postgres_fdw</filename> 中错误的断言（Etsuro Fujita） <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;69f75bf82">&sect;</ulink></para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [701c881f7] 2022-12-21 17:51:50 -0500
