Branch: REL_13_STABLE [e2f21ff60] 2021-06-01 09:27:25 +0900
Branch: REL_12_STABLE [02037af3f] 2021-06-01 09:27:31 +0900
Branch: REL_13_STABLE [949e32ee5] 2021-06-08 13:40:03 +0900
Branch: REL_12_STABLE [b7684bd10] 2021-06-08 13:40:10 +0900
-->
     <para>允许在 MSVC 上构建 GSSAPI 支持（Michael Paquier） <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a75268f1c">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;02037af3f">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b7684bd10">&sect;</ulink></para>

     <para>修复与现代 Kerberos 构建的各种不兼容问题。</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
