     <para>修复事件触发器监控 <command>ALTER TABLE</command> 操作时的释放后使用隐患（Jehan-Guillaume de Rorthais） <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;93f726c04">&sect;</ulink></para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [ba9f18abd] 2020-10-25 13:57:46 -0400
Branch: REL_13_STABLE [d88d8ad28] 2020-10-25 13:57:46 -0400
