Branch: REL_12_STABLE [a8beece95] 2020-02-24 18:14:16 +0900
Branch: REL_11_STABLE [da2a7180a] 2020-02-24 18:14:22 +0900
-->
     <para>在 <application>pg_checksums</application> 及相关程序中忽略 <filename>pg_internal.init</filename> 的临时副本（Michael Paquier） <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a8beece95">&sect;</ulink></para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
