     <para>直接调用 <filename>contrib/lo</filename> 的 <function>lo_manage()</function> 函数，而非作为触发器调用时，会发生崩溃（Tom Lane） <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d56657c35">&sect;</ulink></para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [95f7ddfda] 2020-03-28 17:09:51 -0400
Branch: REL_12_STABLE [2bb6bdbe5] 2020-03-28 17:09:51 -0400
Branch: REL_11_STABLE [5feb3d0b3] 2020-03-28 17:09:51 -0400
