Branch: REL9_4_STABLE [6aa126311] 2019-12-12 12:30:44 -0500
-->
     <para>修复对公元前日期计算 <literal>EXTRACT(ISOYEAR FROM <replaceable>timestamp</replaceable>)</literal> 时结果相差一的问题（Tom Lane） <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;07c4b6ac7">&sect;</ulink></para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [d57d61533] 2019-11-13 15:53:53 -0500
Branch: REL_12_STABLE [5a6eea092] 2019-11-13 15:53:53 -0500
-->
     <para>确保 <type>char</type> 类型的 <literal>&lt;&gt;</literal> 操作符将无法确定排序规则的错误如实报告，而非报告为 <quote>cache lookup failed for collation 0</quote>（Tom Lane） <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5a6eea092">&sect;</ulink></para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [cb5b28613] 2020-02-07 22:06:31 +0900
Branch: REL_12_STABLE [598b466e8] 2020-02-07 22:07:44 +0900
Branch: REL_12_STABLE [4faea7fdf] 2020-02-08 12:29:38 +0900
-->
     <para>避免将 TID 扫描当作顺序扫描（Tatsuhito Kasahara） <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;598b466e8">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4faea7fdf">&sect;</ulink></para>

     <para>重构时的疏漏导致 TID 扫描（按 CTID 选择）在统计视图中被计为顺序扫描，并且像顺序扫描一样获取全表谓词锁。后一种行为可能在可串行化事务模式下导致不必要的串行化错误。</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [4a0aab14d] 2019-11-21 16:21:43 -0500
Branch: REL_12_STABLE [5186f7625] 2019-11-21 16:21:43 -0500
Branch: REL_11_STABLE [669138ebd] 2019-11-21 16:21:44 -0500
Branch: REL_10_STABLE [b9f3d7a53] 2019-11-21 16:21:44 -0500
Branch: REL9_6_STABLE [52434ba73] 2019-11-21 16:21:44 -0500
Branch: REL9_5_STABLE [bcd541897] 2019-11-21 16:21:44 -0500
Branch: REL9_4_STABLE [f09829017] 2019-11-21 16:21:44 -0500
-->
     <para>避免系统目录中存在自引用视图时 <literal>information_schema</literal> 视图发生栈溢出（Tom Lane） <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5186f7625">&sect;</ulink></para>

     <para>自引用视图无法正常工作，它总会导致无限递归。尝试执行视图时，我们已能正确处理这种情况，但在查询它是否可自动更新时却未能正确处理。</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Alvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
Branch: master [b175bd59f] 2020-01-07 17:38:48 -0300
